# No API keys required.
# Breaking-news radio uses bundled audio files (public/assets/radio).
# (Legacy) GEMINI_API_KEY is no longer used by this project.
#
# Optional: point the static client at a separately hosted WebSocket server.
# Leave unset to connect to /ws on the same origin (local dev / single host).
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://your-game-server.example.com/ws
